# Suggested default BAT workspace folder (Settings -> Workspace folder). Collected
# data belongs here, not in the repo — keep everything except the explainer and the
# change log out of git. The data/ subfolder holds agent output.
workspace/*
!workspace/README.md
!workspace/CHANGELOG.md
workspace/data/
